flowchart LR
    subgraph Source
        Push([git push]) --> Hook{Webhook}
    end
    subgraph CI [Continuous integration]
        direction TB
        Lint[Lint] --> Test[Unit tests]
        Test --> Build[Build image]
        Build --> Scan[[Security scan]]
    end
    subgraph CD [Delivery]
        Stage[(Staging)] --> Smoke{Smoke tests}
        Smoke -->|pass| Prod((Production))
        Smoke -->|fail| Rollback>Rollback]
    end
    Hook -->|main| Lint
    Hook -.->|other branches| Lint
    Scan ==> Stage
    Rollback -.-> Stage
    Prod --> Notify[/Notify team/]
    classDef good fill:#cfc,stroke:#0a0
    classDef bad fill:#fcc,stroke:#c00
    class Prod good
    class Rollback bad
